Modstoke Manager by OpenACAI (formerly OpenACAI Mod Manager)
Copyright (C) 2026 Alex Cooper

OpenACAI Mod Manager contains original OpenACAI changes by Alex Cooper.
It is based on RedManager by Toni Macaroni, originally licensed under Apache-2.0.
It installs and manages OpenACAI Endnight Loader packages that are built
on BepInEx's Unity IL2CPP loader and RedLoader/SonsSdk compatibility components.

Upstream projects credited by this manager:

- BepInEx, by the BepInEx team: https://github.com/BepInEx/BepInEx
- RedLoader/SonsSdk and RedManager, by Toni Macaroni:
  https://github.com/ToniMacaroni/RedLoader
  https://github.com/ToniMacaroni/RedManager

The private OpenACAI anti-cheat/admin mod is not part of this public repository.

The manager uses original CSS and system fonts for its interface. It does not
bundle Sons of the Forest textures, splash logos, or fonts. Sons of the Forest
is referenced only to identify the game with which this independent tool works.
